<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 00:33:00 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>布兰奇为激怒特朗普的反应池检察官辩护</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/todd-blanche-attorney-general-reflecting-pool-prosecutor-jeanine-pirro-trump/</link><description>“现在，这与总统是否对那起案件所发生的事情感到非常沮丧是不同的。我不会因此而责怪他。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289203744.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 23:31:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/todd-blanche-attorney-general-reflecting-pool-prosecutor-jeanine-pirro-trump/</guid></item><item><title>《华尔街日报》称，美国对马克·沃尔特的调查主要针对四名中间人</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/fraud-investigation-mark-walter-guggenheim-partners-insurance-companies/</link><description>检察官和美国证券交易委员会正在调查沃尔特或他控制的企业是否通过隐瞒财务关系同时从保险公司借款数十亿美元来实施欺诈。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2268085899-e1786920235376.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 22:48:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/fraud-investigation-mark-walter-guggenheim-partners-insurance-companies/</guid></item><item><title>牛肉价格暴涨终于让美国人达到了消费上限</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/beef-prices-inflation-consumer-spending-limit-cattle-supply/</link><description>截至 7 月中旬的 13 周（包括阵亡将士纪念日和 7 月 4 日这两个关键时期）的牛肉销量同比下降 0.3%。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2276257367-e1786919821229.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 22:41:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/beef-prices-inflation-consumer-spending-limit-cattle-supply/</guid></item><item><title>英国《金融时报》称，戴蒙警告英国首相希利不要提高银行税</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/jamie-dimon-jpmorgan-uk-chancellor-healey-bank-tax-hikes-andy-burnham/</link><description>戴蒙表示，较高的税收往往会导致就业岗位流失，他将纽约金融工作岗位的减少部分归咎于该市的税收负担。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2283873070_f9636a-e1786919344603.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 22:33:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/jamie-dimon-jpmorgan-uk-chancellor-healey-bank-tax-hikes-andy-burnham/</guid></item><item><title>Stripe 斥资超过 70 亿美元收购人工智能公司 OpenRouter</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/stripe-7-billion-deal-ai-firm-openrouter-acquisition/</link><description>这笔交易是在 OpenRouter 以据报道的 13 亿美元估值筹集资金几个月后达成的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2147863391-e1786918883496.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 22:27:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/stripe-7-billion-deal-ai-firm-openrouter-acquisition/</guid></item><item><title>BBC 请求美国法院帮助获取伊万卡·特朗普、贾里德·库什纳和小唐的证词，称他们对诽谤指控拥有“个人知识”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/bbc-us-court-testimony-ivanka-trump-jared-kushner-don-jr-defamation-suit/</link><description>这些指控集中在一部 2024 年纪录片对特朗普于 2021 年 1 月 6 日抗议者袭击华盛顿国会大厦之前发表的演讲进行剪辑的方式。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289419761-e1786918199780.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 22:17:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/bbc-us-court-testimony-ivanka-trump-jared-kushner-don-jr-defamation-suit/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普表示首尔拒绝帮助伊朗，而朝鲜“没有威胁且尊重”，美国将削减与韩国的军事演习</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/us-military-exercises-south-korea-trump-iran-war-north-unthreatening-respectful/</link><description>一天前，特朗普发布了一张自己站在朝鲜金正恩旁边的照片，并写道，两位领导人相处得很好。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26228725686076-e1786917472807.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 22:06:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/us-military-exercises-south-korea-trump-iran-war-north-unthreatening-respectful/</guid></item><item><title>达里奥·阿莫迪承认人工智能正遭受信任危机，他表示人们担心公司或政府正在“想出一些新方法来搞砸他们”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/dario-amodei-anthropic-ai-trust-crisis-regulation-frontier-open-models-negative-views/</link><description>“我认为到目前为止，对包括 Anthropic 在内的人工智能公司最准确的批评是，我们尚未兑现造福世界的重大承诺。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2256664479-e1786910060562.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 21:30:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/dario-amodei-anthropic-ai-trust-crisis-regulation-frontier-open-models-negative-views/</guid></item><item><title>拥有湖人队将为亿万富翁投资者约书亚·库什纳提供标志性的体育特许经营权，以及“强大的税盾”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/lakers-deal-joshua-kushner-thrive-capital-spacex-openai-holdings-tax-shield/</link><description>“我的猜测是，他正准备抵消大量的附带利息收入。如果你拥有一支运动队，如果操作得当，你可以获得收入扣除。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2184416821-e1786903992715.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 19:25:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/lakers-deal-joshua-kushner-thrive-capital-spacex-openai-holdings-tax-shield/</guid></item><item><title>伊朗石油陷入困境，而竞争对手从波斯湾的出口准备激增，但德黑兰可以不惜一切代价打破这一封锁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/iran-oil-exports-hormuz-us-naval-blockade-missiles-aircraft-carrier-lincoln/</link><description>卫星图像显示，霍尔木兹海峡两岸的沙特船只正准备将石油运出波斯湾。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/9869642-e1786896700854.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 17:39:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/iran-oil-exports-hormuz-us-naval-blockade-missiles-aircraft-carrier-lincoln/</guid></item></channel></rss>